{
  "title": "Flatshare",
  "uid": "flatshare",
  "description": "The voice class, the gateway, the engine and the background class, from the gateway's metrics and the engine's it relays (ops/prometheus).",
  "tags": [
    "flatshare"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "label": "Prometheus"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Voice: the realtime class",
      "id": 1,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Realtime first byte, p50 and p95",
      "id": 2,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.25
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(flatshare_gateway_first_byte_seconds_bucket{class=\"realtime\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "flatshare:first_byte_seconds:p95_5m{class=\"realtime\"}",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "description": "From the gateway's receipt of a voice request to the engine's first byte. The objective: 95% within 250 ms (docs/SLO.md)."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests missing their class's objective, 1 - good/valid (realtime's budget: 5%)",
      "id": 3,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "flatshare:sli_miss:ratio_rate5m",
          "legendFormat": "{{class}}, 5 min",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "flatshare:sli_miss:ratio_rate1h{class=\"realtime\"}",
          "legendFormat": "realtime, 1 h",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The service level, failures included: of each class's valid requests (all that ended, but for the clients' faults), the share that did not complete with a 2xx response, or whose first content came after the class's objective (realtime's: 250 ms). A request refused for capacity, timed out, failed or hung until its deadline is a miss, where the first byte's histogram never saw it. Only realtime has an objective by default; the other classes' misses are their requests that did not complete."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Realtime requests a second, by status",
      "id": 4,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(flatshare_gateway_requests_total{class=\"realtime\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "408: an upload too slow; 429: a tenant at its own bound, or the admission queues full; 503: refused for capacity (with Retry-After), not admitted by the queue deadline, the gateway draining, or the engine not ready (upstream_not_ready); 504: no response by a deadline; 502: a request found the engine broken. The outcomes panel below names each."
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "The gateway",
      "id": 5,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests a second, by class",
      "id": 6,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (class) (rate(flatshare_gateway_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{class}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "The gateway's own time, p99 (SLO: 2 ms)",
      "id": 7,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.002
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(flatshare_gateway_overhead_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Upstream errors a second, and broken streams' error events",
      "id": 8,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (rate(flatshare_gateway_upstream_errors_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (class, type) (rate(flatshare_gateway_error_events_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "error events, {{class}}, {{type}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "The engine's readiness, as the gateway sees it",
      "id": 9,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "flatshare_gateway_node_ready",
          "legendFormat": "{{node}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "0 while the gateway answers 503: a request found the engine broken and its /health has not answered since."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Responses being relayed, by class",
      "id": 10,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 18
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (class) (flatshare_gateway_streams_active)",
          "legendFormat": "{{class}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Admission: waiting, and refused a second",
      "id": 11,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 18
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (class) (flatshare_gateway_admission_waiting)",
          "legendFormat": "waiting, {{class}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (class, reason) (rate(flatshare_gateway_admission_refused_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "refused, {{class}} {{reason}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Empty without an [admission] policy, as the deployed configuration runs."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests offered, admitted and ended a second, by class",
      "id": 21,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "flatshare:requests_offered:rate5m",
          "legendFormat": "offered, {{class}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (class) (flatshare:requests_admitted:rate5m)",
          "legendFormat": "admitted, {{class}}",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (class) (flatshare:requests_terminal:rate5m)",
          "legendFormat": "ended, {{class}}",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Every inference request is offered once, when its class is known; admitted once, when it is sent upstream; and ends once, with one outcome. Offered minus ended is what is in flight."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests ended a second, by class and outcome",
      "id": 22,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 26
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "flatshare:requests_terminal:rate5m > 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{class}}: {{outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "completed: a 2xx response relayed to its end. Misses: upstream_server_error, transport_error, not_ready, shed, drained, refused_in_flight, refused_class, refused_body_bytes, refused_queue and the timeouts but timeout_upload. The clients' own, outside the service level: invalid, upstream_client_error, refused_tenant, timeout_upload, stalled, and cancelled before the class's objective passed (the gateway's README, Accounting)."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Admission coverage: the share of offered requests sent upstream",
      "id": 23,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 26
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "flatshare:admission_coverage:ratio_rate5m",
          "legendFormat": "{{class}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Read it beside the first byte's panels, which see only the admitted: a gateway that refuses or times out requests before they go upstream keeps their latency low by serving fewer. Under 1: requests refused, timed out at the admission point, invalid, or answered 503 while the engine was not ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "The engine's state, as inference finds it",
      "id": 24,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 34
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "flatshare_gateway_engine_state",
          "legendFormat": "{{state}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "1 for the current state. warming: no inference has succeeded since the gateway started; serving; degraded: the inference canary failed degraded_after times in a row with nothing succeeding between; drained: the gateway drains. GET /ready answers 200 only while serving (and the engine's /health answers)."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Inference canaries a second, by result",
      "id": 25,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 34
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (result) (rate(flatshare_gateway_canary_probes_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{result}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "None while requests succeed: the canary asks the engine for one token only when no inference succeeded within [canary] interval_s (30 s), and every second while it warms. Empty with [canary] enabled = false, as E2's points run."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests in flight, by class, and a reload's predecessor's",
      "id": 26,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 34
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (class) (flatshare_gateway_in_flight)",
          "legendFormat": "{{class}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "flatshare_gateway_predecessor_in_flight",
          "legendFormat": "a reload's predecessor",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Against max_in_flight (1,024 by default) and each class's [classes.<class>] max_in_flight (128, 256, 512); during a reload the successor counts its predecessor's requests with its own until the predecessor exits."
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "The engine (vLLM, relayed by the gateway), by node",
      "id": 12,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 42
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests running and waiting",
      "id": 13,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 43
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (node) (vllm:num_requests_running)",
          "legendFormat": "running, {{node}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (node) (vllm:num_requests_waiting)",
          "legendFormat": "waiting, {{node}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "KV cache usage, and preemptions a second",
      "id": 14,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 43
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (node) (vllm:kv_cache_usage_perc)",
          "legendFormat": "KV cache usage, {{node}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (node) (rate(vllm:num_preemptions_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "preemptions/s, {{node}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "description": "A full pool while requests wait is the regime where voice turns need the engine change (docs/PRODUCTION.md)."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Prompt tokens a second, by where they came from",
      "id": 15,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 43
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
